 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "planes lists [departureTime, capacity] with distinct departure times; orders lists [shipTime, items] in processing order. For each order, place its items in the given order: each item goes to the plane with the earliest departure time strictly after shipTime whose remaining capacity is at least the item size, and that capacity shrinks by the size. If some item fits no eligible plane, the order is rejected and every capacity returns to its value before the order. Return one list per order: the departure times of the planes chosen for its items, in item order, or [] for a rejected order.",
  "provenance": [
   {
